Package: rarzap
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: RarZap <https://github.com/indmak/RarZap>
Description: RAR to ZIP converter (single-file free edition)
 Fast local RAR -> ZIP conversion with a calm native desktop UI.
 Batch conversion is provided by a separate commercial plugin.
